&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/james-newell-forge"&gt;@james-newell-forge&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a href="https://github.com/spectreconsole/spectre.console/pull/2100" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/spectreconsole/spectre.console/pull/2100/hovercard"&gt;#2100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
